# TypeORM Conventions

## Naming

- All columns use `snake_case` via `name` in `@Column({ name: 'snake_case' })`
- Tables: `@Entity('snake_case_table_name')`
- Enum types in migrations: `COMMENT ON TYPE "EnumName"` (Russian comments)

## Transactions

- Use `queryRunner` in migrations; in services: `manager.transaction()` for atomic ops
- Variant/VariantBarcode: derive `companyId` from relation — never from request body

## Migrations

- Add `COMMENT ON TABLE` and `COMMENT ON COLUMN` in migrations (Russian comments)
- Enum values = API contract; change only via migration + changelog
